0063-glm-prefill-lanes: TensorFold 0.6.2 port series (apply after the lower numbers, patch -p0 in the directory
that holds the installed tensorfold package).
Origin: the 4x RTX PRO 6000 release series (Apache-2.0), first written for TensorFold 0.6.0 + 0001-0056.
Port: applied by a 3-way merge without conflict; the change is the 0.6.0 patch's, at 0.6.2's lines.
Files: families/glm5_next/cuda/ce.py, families/glm5_next/cuda/engine.py, families/glm5_next/cuda/forward.py, families/glm5_next/cuda/hcsplit.py, families/glm5_next/cuda/lanes.py.

